WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.502
Harry Kersh: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.903
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.439
between Shake Shack in the UK and the US.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.874
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.048
In the UK, burgers come in two sizes,

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.783
single and double.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:17.751
Joe Avella: And in the US,

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:18.685
our Shake Shack burgers

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.254
also come in single or double.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:21.287
Harry: We're gonna weigh
the Double ShackBurger

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:22.655
Harry: We're gonna weigh
the Double ShackBurger

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:24.557
to find out if it's actually
the same size in the UK

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.725
as it is in the US.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.196
Joe: Oh, man.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.032
Ours weighs a lot less.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.500
Significantly less.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.568
What's up with that, Shake Shack?

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:35.602
Harry: In the UK, we can
only get fries in one size,

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.904
Harry: In the UK, we can
only get fries in one size,

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:38.938
and this is it.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.106
Joe: In the US, we also

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.009
have only one size of fries.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:43.043
Let's see how much thleh bleh!

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.778
Let's see how much thleh bleh!

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:45.779
What I meant to say was,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.714
let's see how much they weigh!

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:54.988
Harry: So, our portion of
fries came to around 188 grams.

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.356
Joe: What?

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:57.957
Did he say 188?

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.559
Ours is, like, a little over 100.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.429
Like, when I say 105, I might be generous.

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.663
It's a lot less.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.733
So far, the fries and the burger

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:11.204
have been significantly
smaller than the UK.

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:14.140
I thought we were the ones
with the big portions.

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:15.275
Harry: Drinks from a UK Shake Shack

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:18.445
come in two sizes, regular and large.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.946
Joe: The US, we also have

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.248
only two fountain-drink sizes,

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.917
regular and large.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.918
Harry: We're gonna
measure them to find out

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.386
how much is actually in these.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.189
So, a regular drink from a UK Shake Shack

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.724
has about 400 milliliters in it.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:34.127
Joe: Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, woop.

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:35.728
Oh, I should've done the big one first.

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.468
Little over 16 ounces.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:46.506
[laughs]

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:48.975
It fits. That's good.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.811
It has gone slightly over the scales.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.446
I'm gonna, in my infinite wisdom,

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:56.449
assume that's around 600 milliliters.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:57.383
Give or take a few.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.788
Joe: So that's 16.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.023
Jump to the little guy.

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:07.760
Huh.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.262
6 1/2.

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:12.465
16 plus 6 is 24?

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.100
Right?

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.301
22?

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.136
Heh.

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:17.871
We'll give it a half,

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.473
so 22 1/2 fluid ounces for the large.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.675
Harry: Milkshakes in the
UK only come in one size.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:23.510
We're not sure what it is,

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.844
so, again, we're gonna measure it.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:28.414
Joe: In the US, our shakes
also come in one size.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:32.018
I mean, this thing might
be to-the-line 16 ounces.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:35.922
Uh-oh, got some bad news, Conner.

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.291
Looks like it's a little under 16 ounces.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:40.593
Mm.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.196
Harry: Importantly, in the UK you can also

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.497
get beer from Shake Shack.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.833
This normally comes in
a serving of one pint.

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.735
However, unfortunately,
due to the reduced menu

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.770
from the pandemic, we
couldn't get one today.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.839
Joe: The Shake Shacks in the US

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.374
are still serving beer.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.409
So, the ones we got to go were cans.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.244
Got the 12 ounce and the 16 ounce.

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:01.080
I'm gonna assume, since
it's the same size cup,

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.550
that this is a pint.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.751
Harry: Fun pint fact for you.

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:06.586
Our pints in the UK are actually bigger

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:07.921
than your pints in the US.

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.122
We use imperial measurements,

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:11.257
and our pints are around 19 ounces,

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.892
whereas yours are 16.

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:15.128
Joe: If all pints were
magically half the size,

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.162
I'm just drinking twice as much.

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:18.364
I've never stopped to think

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.166
how many fluid ounces is in a beer.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:23.036
It's like, get me outta here!

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:24.804
Harry: What about hot dogs?

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:26.773
Well, a hot dog from a UK Shake Shack

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:30.043
is 6 1/2 inches long.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.544
[Joe sighs]

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:35.982
What in the heck is this?

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:38.284
They cut the hot dog in half?

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:39.586
Cursed image.

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:47.694
Am I getting punk'd here?

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:50.330
First Five Guys, and now Shake Shack?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.966
I get it, I'm fighting a losing battle.

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:55.301
Against normal hot dogs.

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:57.170
Yeah, I mean, Five Guys reached out to me.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.504
Haven't heard back from them, though,

00:03:58.504 --> 00:03:59.639
at the recording of this.

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.708
Shake Shack, you're on the list now too.

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.177
You're on the list now too.

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:05.645
I wanna know what's going
on with these hot dogs.

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:08.381
I did not bring the tape measurer,

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:12.352
but the good people at Apple have an app

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:14.887
that measures stuff for us.

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:17.991
This shoot, of course,
is sponsored by Apple.

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:20.226
All right.

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:22.362
So, I'm going to measure this hot dog.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.332
This is actually working!

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:28.701
6 1/2 inches.

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.303
Thank you, Apple.

00:04:30.303 --> 00:04:34.207
Harry: And it weighs 126 grams.

00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:37.910
Joe: It looks like it's,
like, exactly on 125.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.245
Harry: And last but by no means least,

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:40.647
Shake Shack in the UK and the US

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:42.482
are both known for being
quite dog-friendly.

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:42.515
And as such, you can 
get dog treats.

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:46.019
And as such, you can 
get dog treats.

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:46.052
These are red velvet dog treats,

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:48.221
These are red velvet dog treats,

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:50.089
and they come in packs of five.

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:51.391
Joe: They were saying
theirs are red velvet.

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.159
I don't know what ours are supposed to be.

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:54.627
Oh, it's got the Shake Shack logo on it.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:55.461
You see that?

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:58.531
Ooh, I don't like how they smell.

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:01.434
[crunching]

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:04.203
Oddly a little bit like a Communion wafer.

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:11.944
I'm not getting red velvet.

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:14.047
Now we're gonna get the
expert opinion on dog treats.

00:05:15.014 --> 00:05:17.150
Doggo: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.218
this is "Doggo Wars."

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:23.156
Hey, Mabel.

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:24.557
Megan Ingham: Yeah, there's chips on the floor.

