Mabel: Yum.
Megan: Mabel, stay!

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.399
[laughing]

00:05:33.399 --> 00:05:34.567
Harry: This is Mabel the dog,

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:35.601
and we're gonna get her thoughts

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:37.303
on the dog treats from Shake Shack.

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:40.373
What'd you think, Mabel?
Mabel: Wow.

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:42.308
Harry: Not bad?
Mabel: Not bad.

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:43.609
