00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:50.149
so, good job, guys.

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:51.984
Joe: Bring me the dogs.

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:53.920
[Joe whistling]

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.822
Hey, Paul!

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:57.590
What do you think?

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.092
Both dogs: Treat!

00:05:59.092 --> 00:06:00.259
Joe: You want a big one?

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:05.732
How is it, how is it, how is it?

00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:07.633
Luda: Needs salt.

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:08.568
Joe: I mean, you see that,

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:09.502
you see what I was talking about before

00:06:09.502 --> 00:06:11.003
about, like, they're like,

