top favorite go-to dog treats,

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:24.250
but in a pinch, yeah.

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:28.688
So, what've you been up
to during quarantine?

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:35.094
Harry: Unfortunately, Shake
Shack in the UK doesn't disclose

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:37.630
any of its nutritional information.

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:40.500
Joe: However, we can get
nutritional information in the US.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.536
So let's start with the
calories in a standard meal.

00:06:43.536 --> 00:06:46.539
If you get the Double
ShackBurger and the fries

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:50.676
and a chocolate shake, you're
looking at 2,010 calories,

00:06:50.676 --> 00:06:52.111
which is just a little bit over

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:55.615
your entire daily recommended allowance.

00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:58.151
So just eat this every day once.

00:06:58.151 --> 00:07:00.353
What if you're in the mood for
something even unhealthier?

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:03.956
Well, this right here is the
Double SmokeShack burger,

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:07.260
and it's the most calorific
standard burger at Shake Shack.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.096
Clocks in at 870 calories.

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:11.063
Just the burger.

00:07:11.063 --> 00:07:12.465
Harry: This is also the menu item

00:07:12.465 --> 00:07:13.566
with the highest fat content.

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:16.436
In the US, one of these
contains 57 grams of fat,

00:07:16.436 --> 00:07:18.838
which is 73% of your daily allowance.

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:21.007
Joe: It's also the
saltiest thing on the menu.

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:24.177
A Double SmokeShack contains a huge

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:26.245
3,030 milligrams of sodium.

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:30.016
That's over 130% of your daily allowance.

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:31.684
Harry: Shake Shack is also
unique in its approach

00:07:31.684 --> 00:07:33.853
to regional specialties, with
pretty much every location

00:07:33.853 --> 00:07:36.022
having an exclusive burger or custard.

00:07:36.022 --> 00:07:38.925
However, some of these are
way less healthy than others.

00:07:38.925 --> 00:07:40.760
Joe: For example, the least healthy burger

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.895
found on any Shake Shack menu

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:45.031
is a Lockhart Link burger.

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:47.500
This is exclusive only to Austin, Texas,

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.001
so listen up, all you

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:51.504
relocating tech bros and Joe Rogan.

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:55.308
This is a burger with
jalapeño cheese, ShakeSauce,

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:58.244
pickles, and a sausage
link from Kreuz Market

00:07:58.244 --> 00:08:00.446
in, you guessed it, Lockhart.

00:08:00.446 --> 00:08:01.881
Harry: If you get one
of these as a triple,

00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:04.283
it contains over half
of your daily calories,

00:08:04.283 --> 00:08:06.619
more than 100% of your daily fat,

00:08:06.619 --> 00:08:08.988
and almost double your daily sodium.

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:10.289
Joe: But the most calorific item

00:08:10.289 --> 00:08:11.557
found on any Shake Shack menu

00:08:11.557 --> 00:08:12.725
actually isn't a burger.

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:14.994
It's something called
the Double Down fries.

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:16.696
They're found only in Vegas.

00:08:16.696 --> 00:08:18.264
Double Down? Got it? OK.

00:08:18.264 --> 00:08:20.900
And they contain 1,910 calories.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:25.404
Those fries alone are 95%
of your daily allowance.

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:26.572
I mean, give me a break. You're in Vegas.

00:08:26.572 --> 00:08:28.541
Like you care at all, right?

00:08:28.541 --> 00:08:30.276
Give me the fries, I just lost my fortune.

00:08:33.045 --> 00:08:34.514
Harry: Unfortunately,
Shake Shack in the UK

00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:36.682
also doesn't disclose its ingredients.

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:38.084
Bit shady. What's going on there, guys?

00:08:38.084 --> 00:08:39.685
Give us some info to work with.

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:41.254
Joe: And that's also
the case here in the US.

00:08:41.254 --> 00:08:42.855
We've reached out to them to see

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:44.123
if they'd make an exception,

00:08:44.123 --> 00:08:46.826
but they could not help us out.

00:08:46.826 --> 00:08:48.828
Harry: What we can get
is a list of allergens,

00:08:48.828 --> 00:08:50.429
and it has a couple of fun things to note.

00:08:50.429 --> 00:08:53.266
For example, there is a
significant risk of there being

00:08:53.266 --> 00:08:55.902
traces of seafood in
our banoffee concrete,

00:08:55.902 --> 00:08:57.069
and they're also sulfites

00:08:57.069 --> 00:08:59.772
in our chicken bites
and in the ShackSauce.

00:08:59.772 --> 00:09:02.275
Joe: We may or may not also have shellfish

00:09:02.275 --> 00:09:04.610
in our 'Shroom burger, ShackBurger,

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.979
Shack Stack, and SmokeShack.

00:09:06.979 --> 00:09:09.015
So, there's no potential
seafood in the UK equivalents

00:09:09.015 --> 00:09:10.616
of these burgers, so I have no idea

00:09:10.616 --> 00:09:12.518
why there might be shellfish
in ours here in the US.

00:09:12.518 --> 00:09:14.186
I couldn't even guess why.

00:09:14.186 --> 00:09:16.322
But in better news, all our Shake Shacks,

00:09:16.322 --> 00:09:20.059
US beef, it's freshly
ground 100% Angus beef

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:22.395
that's free from hormones and antibiotics.

00:09:22.395 --> 00:09:24.230
And the buns are non-GMO.

00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:28.634
Harry: Here is everything
you can only find

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:30.770
on the menu at a UK Shake Shack.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:33.806
Joe: Here are all the
US-exclusive Shake Shack items

00:09:33.806 --> 00:09:35.841
you cannot get in the UK.

00:09:35.841 --> 00:09:37.276
Harry: Let's start with the burgers.

00:09:37.276 --> 00:09:39.912
Here we have the 
ShackMeister burger.

00:09:39.912 --> 00:09:41.847
Now, this is a double version.

00:09:41.847 --> 00:09:44.684
It comes with beef patties,
cheese, ShackSauce,

00:09:44.684 --> 00:09:47.386
and then some crispy
ale-marinated shallots.

00:09:47.486 --> 00:09:49.055
Yes, we pronounce it "shall-OTS."

00:09:49.055 --> 00:09:50.323
That's the correct way to pronounce it.

00:09:50.323 --> 00:09:51.190
You guys are wrong.

00:09:51.324 --> 00:09:52.391
For a limited time in the UK

00:09:52.391 --> 00:09:55.394
we can also get a spicy version
of the chicken sandwich,

00:09:55.394 --> 00:09:57.597
