00:09:57.597 --> 00:09:58.931
This comes in hot,

00:09:58.931 --> 00:10:00.967
or extra hot if you're feeling bold.

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:02.268
We would usually be able to get some

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:03.803
more exclusive hot-dog options,

00:10:03.803 --> 00:10:05.972
